+plugin_link( 'https://wordpress.org/plugins/advanced-custom-fields/' )

p This plugin allows assigning colors and images for categories.
p Colors will be displayed in navigation menu category archive link, and in posts list on category archive page.
p Category image will be displayed in page intro section on category archive page.

p The theme also allows assigning pages to categories. That way you can create topic dedicated sections for your website consisting from both pages and posts. Pages will be displayed above posts list on category archive page.

+tip( 'Secure Custom Fields plugin', 'h5' )
	p You can alternatively use <a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/secure-custom-fields/"><strong>Secure Custom Fields</strong> plugin</a>.
